26
00:04:16,588 --> 00:04:21,843
[Host] Packaging is the last stage of chipmaking, also known as the back-end process.

27
00:04:22,444 --> 00:04:24,747
[Vocab] 段階

28
00:04:25,148 --> 00:04:27,644
[Host] It means a stage, or a step.

29
00:04:28,244 --> 00:04:39,451
[Slow] 人工知能、AIの広がりで、性能の高い半導体の需要が世界中で高まっています。

30
00:04:40,252 --> 00:04:46,708
