32
00:04:49,939 --> 00:04:51,644
[Host] It means demand.

33
00:04:52,244 --> 00:05:05,180
[Slow] サムスン電子は、2024年からの5年間で、この拠点におよそ400億円を投資する計画です。

34
00:05:05,980 --> 00:05:13,060
[Host] Samsung plans to invest about forty billion yen in the center over five years, starting in 2024.

35
00:05:13,660 --> 00:05:15,915
