36
00:05:16,315 --> 00:05:18,043
[Host] It means investment.

37
00:05:18,644 --> 00:05:29,036
[Slow] このうち、日本政府が最大200億円、横浜市が25億円を補助します。

38
00:05:29,836 --> 00:05:37,851
[Host] Of that, the Japanese government will cover up to twenty billion yen, and the city of Yokohama two and a half billion.

39
00:05:38,451 --> 00:05:40,468
[Vocab] 補助

40
00:05:40,867 --> 00:05:43,675
[Host] It means a subsidy — financial support.

41
00:05:44,276 --> 00:05:57,019
[Slow] サムスン電子は、こうした日本の会社と協力して、新しい技術の開発を速く進めたい考えです。

42
00:05:57,819 --> 00:06:03,795
[Host] Samsung wants to team up with these Japanese companies to speed up development of new technology.

43
